"nodeId":735250101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":332078762,"text":"はぁ、また嵐姉に迷惑かけちゃうぞ…でもまあ、仕方ないか…やることがこんなに多いのに、僕一人で対処しきれるわけないもんな。","nextNodeIds":[735250102]},{"nodeId":735250102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":4173059194,"text":"もう一回、測量図の締切を延ばしてもらうしかないかな。このままだと、スメールでの生活費だけで、もらった前金を使い切っちゃうよ…","nextNodeIds":[735250103]},{"nodeId":735250103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":2701242010,"text":"でも、やっぱり一番怖いのは怒った嵐姉だよなぁ…はぁ…","nextNodeIds":[735250104]},{"nodeId":735250104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1711574426,"text":"あれ、どうしてこんなところに璃月の冒険者がいるんだ…","nextNodeIds":[735250105]},{"nodeId":735250105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":120762418,"text":"なあ、そこの冒険者協会の人！","nextNodeIds":[735250106]},{"nodeId":735250106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":4293449626,"text":"えっ、何？ここの川岸って休憩しちゃいけなかったのかい？","nextNodeIds":[735250107]},{"nodeId":735250107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1254420306,"text":"いやいや、オイラたちはただ、おまえが気になって…","nextNodeIds":[735250108]},{"nodeId":735250108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1600598426,"text":"璃月の冒険者がスメールにいる…","nextNodeIds":[735250109]},{"nodeId":735250109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1745260282,"text":"滅多にないことだし、悩んでそうな顔してたから、なにか手伝えないかと思って話しかけたんだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[735250110]},{"nodeId":735250110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":2727290738,"text":"そうだったんだね。僕は沛休、二人は？","nextNodeIds":[735250111]},{"nodeId":735250111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1785120866,"text":"#オイラはパイモン、こいつは{NICKNAME}だ！それで、沛休はどうしてスメールに来たんだ？あっ、もしかして迷子か？","nextNodeIds":[735250112]},{"nodeId":735250112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":814469402,"text":"あーっはっはっはっ、おチビちゃん、パイモンって言うんだ、ははははっ、ま、迷子って…","nextNodeIds":[735250113]},{"nodeId":735250113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2264139858,"text":"そんなに面白かったか？","nextNodeIds":[735250114,735250115]},{"nodeId":735250114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2278162154,"text":"まあまあ面白かった。","nextNodeIds":[735250116]},{"nodeId":735250116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":935311714,"text":"…僕が普通の人だったら何も面白くないけど、地図測量士が迷子だと勘違いされたって思うと、一気に面白くなっちゃって。","nextNodeIds":[735250117]},{"nodeId":735250117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":914727362,"text":"ち、地図測量士？","nextNodeIds":[735250118]},{"nodeId":735250118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":732083714,"text":"そう、昔の地図から何か変化がないか調査するお仕事だよ…これも冒険者協会の職責の一つなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735250119]},{"nodeId":735250119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":749839354,"text":"そんで、ちょうど僕もその地図測量士の一人なんだ。ただ…","nextNodeIds":[735250120]},{"nodeId":735250120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":914031666,"text":"ただ？","nextNodeIds":[735250121]},{"nodeId":735250121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":472681698,"text":"僕はまだ見習いでさ、簡単な測量はしたことあるけど、間違いが多かったんだよね。だから木々に遮られている谷とか地下道まで行って、逐一調査しないといけないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735250122]},{"nodeId":735250122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":125547714,"text":"はぁ、もう難しすぎて嫌になっちゃうよ。スメールの地形ってめちゃくちゃ複雑なんだもんな。通路とか洞窟だらけで、全部の山に穴が空いてるんじゃないかって疑っちゃうくらいだ…","nextNodeIds":[735250123]},{"nodeId":735250123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3547010794,"text":"それでなかなか捗らなくて…はぁ…僕って現地の人間でもないし、ここの地形には全然詳しくないんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[735250124]},{"nodeId":735250124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3991264634,"text":"えっ、だったらどうしてスメールの冒険者に測量させないんだ？","nextNodeIds":[735250125]},{"nodeId":735250125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3829299698,"text":"ええと…実はこれ、スメールと璃月の合同プロジェクトでさ、作った地図はスメールと璃月を行き来して貿易したり冒険したりする人たちに提供するんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735250126]},{"nodeId":735250126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3951102778,"text":"で、璃月側がやることになったのは…元々このプロジェクトを担当するはずだった先輩がすごく経験豊富で、みんなが彼女のことをすごく頼りにしてたからなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735250127]},{"nodeId":735250127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":1392385426,"text":"噂だけど、その先輩は昔、翹英荘で似たような仕事をしてたらしくて、どんなに複雑な地形でも、一目見ただけで状況を大体把握できて、作図の精度もすごく高いんだって。","nextNodeIds":[735250128]},{"nodeId":735250128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3659856354,"text":"でもその人は直後に鉱区に行っちゃって。えっと…あれ…層岩巨淵だったか、黒岩場だったか忘れちゃったな…","nextNodeIds":[735250129]},{"nodeId":735250129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":972657034,"text":"とにかく、彼女が作ったものにかなう地図なんて誰にも作れない。その地図を使った冒険者たちもずっと称賛してたんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[735250130]},{"nodeId":735250130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":1246078490,"text":"僕なんかダメダメだよ…測量したはいいものの、漏れとか抜けが多くて、再調査に手間取っちゃって…","nextNodeIds":[735250131]},{"nodeId":735250131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":2571927650,"text":"はぁ…スメールの冒険者協会の協力があるとはいえ、やっぱり土地勘がないと効率がよくないや。このままだと、もらった前金が全部旅費で消えちゃいそうだよ。","nextNodeIds":[735250132]},{"nodeId":735250132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":866887994,"text":"うぅ…すごくかわいそうだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[735250133]},{"nodeId":735250133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2975842194,"text":"でも、オイラたちは地図の測量なんて分からないしな…もし美味しいものがあるところを地図に記すだけなら、手伝えるんだけどな…","nextNodeIds":[735250134]},{"nodeId":735250134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3832179370,"text":"ははっ、それは良い考えだね。次はグルメ地図みたいなものを作ってみるか。きっとみんなにウケるね。","nextNodeIds":[735250135]},{"nodeId":735250135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3935280210,"text":"でも…実は今してることって、作図とはあんまり関係ないんだよな。どっちかって言うと、調査だから…","nextNodeIds":[735250136]},{"nodeId":735250136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":201947178,"text":"まだ数カ所危険な場所が残ってるんだけど、地形が険しくて、調査のために中に入っていけないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[735250137]},{"nodeId":735250137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":881559410,"text":"あれ、そういうことなら…","nextNodeIds":[735250138]},{"nodeId":735250138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1264449162,"text":"難しくないかも？","nextNodeIds":[735250139]},{"nodeId":735250139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4064612482,"text":"そうだな、オイラたちでも手伝えそうだな！","nextNodeIds":[735250140]},{"nodeId":735250140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":1574434402,"text":"…でもその場所って、本当に危ないんだよ。魔物も徘徊してるかもだし。","nextNodeIds":[735250141]},{"nodeId":735250141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3079035546,"text":"それなら尚更、オイラたちに頼らないとだな！","nextNodeIds":[735250142]},{"nodeId":735250142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":3772187602,"text":"ほ、本当かい？二人に手伝ってもらえるなら、調査の仕事もすぐに終わりそうだ。そしたら、測量図の提出も締切に間に合うし。","nextNodeIds":[735250143]},{"nodeId":735250143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":138717002,"text":"何より大事なのは、行き来する旅人たちが更新後の地図を使えるってことだよね。古い地図に惑わされて、ひと気のない危険なところに迷い込まずに済むはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[735250144]},{"nodeId":735250144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":711309050,"text":"そうだな、でも、へへっ、オイラたちが手伝うのにも条件があるぞ…あとでおまえがグルメ地図を作ったときは、オイラたちにも一枚送ってくれよな！","nextNodeIds":[735250145]},{"nodeId":735250145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","textMapHash":4192283594,"text":"ははは、それはもちろん。でも、まずはこの地図の調査を完成させないとね！はい、じゃあまずは地図を受け取ってくれ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":735250115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1306987130,"text":"5点中3点かな…","nextNodeIds":[735250116]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7352501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30402"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7352501],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30402,"speakerName":"沛休","count":26},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":15},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173525],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2671608358,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Sumeru_73525/Q7352501","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG